  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Chronic Crisis Stream 2023-27-DRC-SARCAF</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The following project aims to support communities by conflicts especially SGBV survivors by providing the following services:&#xa0;
450 SGBV will be supported by psychosocial assistance, medical and legal assistance.
200 SGBV will be supported to access on Income generating activities through access on cash.
Locals leaders will be trained on preventives measure against SGBV and peacebuilding.
Locals leaders and communities members will train on conflict resolution and prevention mechanism.&#xa0;
In order to strength the resilience of communities affected by ongoing crisis,PVCA session will be conducted, and CAPs will be support in order to reduce the risks and chocs faced by communities.&#xa0;
Finally this project will contribute as much possible to reduce the effect of climate change by training communities and locals leaders on climate change effect but also by supporting some actions at small scale to reduce the climate change effects.</narrative>
  </description>
